THE CORPUS

The 186 prayers in this repository are modern adaptations of prayers from "The Valley of
Vision: A Collection of Puritan Prayers and Devotions", edited by Arthur Bennett and
published by The Banner of Truth Trust in 1975.

The underlying Puritan sources are public domain. The compilation itself — its selection,
its titles and its arrangement — is in copyright to Banner of Truth, and this repository
follows that selection and those titles. No adaptation reproduces the original wording;
each was rewritten from the theological themes of its source, and each carries a
provenance record naming what it was adapted from and what the adaptation did.

No licence is granted over the adaptations or over the corpus files. All rights are
reserved in them, and nothing here should be read as a grant of rights in the underlying
compilation, which is not the copyright holder's to give.
